# Keeps this directory present in Git even when no VM manifests exist.
#
# Without this, once the last VirtualMachine manifest is removed (e.g. by
# the Temporal workflow's saga compensation), git stops tracking the
# now-empty manifests/ directory entirely — and ArgoCD treats a path that
# doesn't exist in the repo as an error ("Unknown" sync status), not as
# "zero resources desired". That leaves ArgoCD unable to compute or apply
# pruning for whatever it previously deployed. Do not delete this file.
